<<43>> Give me an activity for a 3rd grade student learning science. It should be an exercise on magnetism. It should be an exercise on materials.
<<43>> \begin{enumerate}
\item Hold a magnet in each hand.
\item Bring the two magnets together slowly.
\item What happens when the magnets are touching?
\item Slowly pull the magnets apart.
\item What happens as they move apart?
\item Hold one magnet in your hand.
\item Slowly bring it towards your hand.
\item What happens as the magnet approaches your hand?
\item Repeat this with your other hand.
\item Compare what happens when you use one magnet compared to when you use two magnets.
\item What do you notice?
\item Share your results with the class.
\end{enumerate}
