<<54>> Give me a writing exercise for a 6th grade student learning English. It should be an exercise on word endings.
<<54>> Write the plural of these nouns by adding the correct suffix:
\begin{enumerate}
\item hobby
\item party
\item story
\item ferry
\item journey
\item hobby
\item secretary
\item victory
