<<90>> Give me a translation exercise for a student learning Spanish. It should have a subsection for answers. It should be an exercise on translating sentences.
<<90>> Translate the following sentences from Spanish to English.  
\begin{enumerate}
    \item Pedro trabaja con su padre.
    \item Juan come con su familia.
    \item ¿Tú bailas con tu novia?
    \item Él juega con su perro.
    \item Yo trabajo con mi mamá.
\end{enumerate}

\subsection*{Answers}
\begin{enumerate}
\item Pedro works with his father.
\item Juan eats with his family.
\item Do you dance with your girlfriend?
\item He plays with his dog.
\item I work with my mom.
\end{enumerate}
