<<136>> Give me an arithmetic exercise for a 4th grade student learning mathematics. It should be an exercise on finding missing fractions. It should have multiple steps.
<<136>> Write the missing numerators and denominators.

\begin{enumerate}[label=\alph*.]
\item \(\frac{1}{3} = \frac{\_\_}{9}\)
