ll you tell them how to book the holiday? Will you give them a date by which they must book? Will you give them a warning that only a few places are left? Will you tell them that they can win a free holiday? Will you tell them that they will get a discount if they book early? Will you give them other information, such as what clothes they need to take, what vaccinations they need, what languages the local people speak, what food they will eat, what animals they may see and what diseases they may catch? Will you tell them what the weather will be like and what water sports they can do? Will you tell them that they can go bungee jumping or paragliding? Will you tell them about the local wildlife and the forests they can visit? Will you tell them that they can visit the local schools and villages? Will you tell them that they can take a flight in a small aeroplane? Will you tell them that they can visit the Taj Mahal? Will you tell them that they can go shopping? Will you tell them that they can take a trip along the River Ganges? Will you tell them that they can go to a Bollywood film show? Will you tell them that they can eat a curry? Will you tell them that they can visit a snake charmer? Will you tell them that they can go to a gymkhana meeting? Will you tell them that they can visit the Golden Temple? Will you tell them that they can go to the top of the Qutub Minar? Will you tell them that they can go to a cricket match? Will you tell them that they can go to the Red Fort? Will you tell them that they can take a trip on the Metro? Will you tell them that they can go to a restaurant? Will you tell them that they can buy souvenirs? Will you tell them that they can go to a museum? Will you tell them that they can visit the local markets? Will you tell them that they can go to a park? Will you tell them that they can go to a bird sanctuary? Will you tell them that they can visit the local zoo? Will you tell them that they can go to a sports centre? Will you tell them