\paragraph{Think With Me}
Describe how you would make a program that asks for your name, then says your name. Then, think about how you would change the program so it asks for your name, then says "Hello" and your name. Finally, consider how you would make a program that asks for your name and age, then says "Hello" and your name, and "You are" and your age. What steps would you take to approach each of these tasks, and how would you ensure the programs work as intended? Describe your thought process and the actions you would take.  

\paragraph{Bonus Question}
