    \item I am tired of this situation.
    \item They are afraid of losing their jobs.
    \item We are glad you like it.
    \item She is ashamed of her behavior.
    \item They are proud of their new house.
    \item He is tired of waiting.
    \item I am sorry to hear that.
    \item They are glad you could come.
    \item We are thinking of traveling to Europe.
\end{enumerate}

