<<502>> Give me a combination of a creative exercise and a writing exercise for a 2nd grade student learning English.
<<502>> Write a story about a character who is in a different place. You can choose where your character is. You can choose who your character is. You can choose what happens to your character. The only thing you cannot choose is the first sentence of your story. The first sentence of your story is: I woke up and looked around.\\

