<<608>> Give me a combination of a fill in the blanks and a grammar exercise for a student learning Spanish. It should have a subsection for answers. It should be an exercise on adjectives.
<<608>> Complete the sentences with the correct form of the adjectives in brackets.  
\begin{enumerate}
    \item Ellos son (chino) \_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_. (They are Chinese.)
    \item Nosotros somos (francés) \_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_. (We are French.)
    \item El vestido es (rosa) \_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_ y (amarillo) \_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_. (The dress is pink and yellow.)
    \item ¿Tú eres (ruso) \_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_ o (ucranio) \_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_? (Are you Russian or Ukrainian?)
    \item Yo soy (turco) \_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_. (I am Turkish.)
\end{enumerate}

\subsection*{Answers}
\begin{enumerate}
\item Ellos son chinos.
\item Nosotros somos franceses.
\item El vestido es rosa y amarillo.
\item ¿Tú eres ruso o ucranio?
\item Yo soy turco.
\end{enumerate}
