<<696>> Give me a combination of a data collection exercise, a short answer exercise, and an activity for a 3rd grade student learning geography.
<<696>> \begin{enumerate}
\item Use an atlas to find the names of some of the large cities on the coast of the Mediterranean Sea.
\item Choose one of these cities and use reference books or the Internet to find out some basic facts about the city.
