nderstanding. Reflect on what you learned about assessing knowledge of robots. What did you find interesting or surprising? Describe your thoughts and feelings about evaluating understanding of robots. Consider the differences between various types of robots. Describe the unique features and abilities of different robots. Think about how you would compare and contrast robots. Describe the similarities and differences you would highlight. Imagine you are creating a timeline of robot development. What key events would you include? Describe the milestones you would highlight in the history of robotics. Reflect on what you learned about the evolution of robots. What did you find interesting or surprising? Describe your thoughts and feelings about the development of robots. Think about how you would design a robot that could help with a specific task. Describe the features and abilities your robot would have. Imagine you are creating a poster about robots. What would you include on your poster? Describe the information and images you would use. Think about how you would present your poster to others. Describe how you would explain the information on your poster. Reflect on what you learned about creating a poster about robots. What did you find interesting or surprising? Describe your thoughts and feelings about presenting information on robots. Consider the potential risks of using robots. Describe the dangers you
